      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu alimwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niwekee wakfu wazaliwa wote wa kwanza wa kiume, maana wazaliwa wote wa kwanza wa kiume wa Waisraeli na kila wazaliwa wa kwanza wa wanyama ni wangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akawaambia watu, “Ikumbukeni siku hii mliyotoka nchini Misri ambako mlikuwa watumwa. Hii ndiyo siku Mwenyezi-Mungu alipowatoa humo kwa mkono wake wenye nguvu. Katika siku hii, kamwe msile mkate uliotiwa chachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hii, mwezi wa kwanza wa Abibu, mtaondoka nchini Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakati Mwenyezi-Mungu atakapowafikisha katika nchi ya Wakanaani, Wahiti, Waamori, Wahivi na Wayebusi, nchi ambayo aliwaapia babu zenu kwamba atawapa nyinyi, nchi inayotiririka maziwa na asali, ni lazima muiadhimishe sikukuu hii kila mwaka katika mwezi huu wa kwanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa muda wa siku saba mtakula mikate isiyotiwa chachu, na mnamo siku ya saba mtafanya sikukuu kwa heshima ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa muda huo wa siku saba mtakula mikate isiyotiwa chachu. Kusiwepo na mikate iliyotiwa chachu, wala chachu yoyote miongoni mwenu na katika nchi yenu yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo mtawaambia watoto wenu kwamba mnafanya hivyo kwa sababu ya jambo alilowafanyia Mwenyezi-Mungu mlipoondoka nchini Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adhimisho hilo litakuwa ukumbusho, kama alama katika mikono yenu au katika paji la nyuso zenu; ili iwakumbushe daima sheria ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. Maana, Mwenyezi-Mungu amewatoa nchini Misri kwa mkono wenye nguvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, mtaadhimisha sikukuu hii kwa wakati uliopangwa, kila mwaka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
